DESCRIPTION:Cookie Monster Day falls on November 2 and marks the blue\, ins
 atiable Sesame Street monster who has been eating things on camera since 1
 969. The date is widely given as Cookie Monster's birthday\, though Sesame
  Workshop does not say so on its own sites. What is documented\, in the Sm
 ithsonian's catalog record for the original puppet\, is stranger than a bi
 rthday: Cookie Monster began as a sharp-toothed snack-food villain who sto
 le wheels.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/cookie-monster-day/
